[level_1]
Name=sunrise 1

Line1 =Flying conditions in our
Line2 =galaxy are really different
Line3 =from yours.
Line4 =You will have to learn how to
Line5 =fly and fight again.
Line6 =Let's start with a simple
Line7 =flying exercise,
Line8 =you have two minutes to finish
Line9 =it.


Time=175
Bonus=1000

[level_2]
Name=sunrise 2
Line1 =OK. You can fly, but what
Line2 =about fighting at the same
Line3 =time.
Line4 =Destroy every target and
Line5 =watch your time.

Time=200
Bonus=1000

[level_3]
Name=sunrise 3
Line1 =Same thing but now the guns
Line2 =are loaded.
Line3 =Don't forget to reload your
Line4 =shield.


Time=0
Bonus=5000

[level_4]
Name=sunrise 4
Line1 =Our galaxy is a mine field,
Line2 =to locate and destroy them is
Line3 =often the key to success in
Line4 =your mission.
Line5 =A good occasion for you to
Line6 =experiment the 3D radar (R)
Line7 =and the self guided missiles.
Line8 =You have only a limited
Line9 =number.


[level_5]
Name=sunrise 5

Line1 =Last training session, destroy
Line2 =every target in each area
Line3 =(check on the left hand side
Line4 =of your sight), then go to the
Line5 =Nav point and press Q for the
Line6 =next area.
Line7 =You will then be ready for a
Line8 =real fight.

Time=0
Bonus=5000

@
